CHURCH_KEY_ALT1_CHAR_Y   EQU 3
CHURCH_KEY_ALT2_SCREEN_X EQU 15
CHURCH_KEY_ALT2_SCREEN_Y EQU 6
CHURCH_KEY_ALT2_CHAR_X   EQU 4
CHURCH_KEY_ALT2_CHAR_Y   EQU 3
